# Scopewise has two deployables, each with its own env file:
#
#   apps/web/.env.example  public build settings (VITE_BASE, VITE_API_BASE_URL). Never put secrets here:
#                          everything in apps/web ends up in the static bundle.
#   apps/api/.env.example  secrets for the serverless API (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, JIRA_*, DATABASE_URL, ...).
#
# Scripts (push-to-jira, precompute --live, eval --live) read the same variables as the API, from the
# environment or apps/api/.env.
